#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:147
msgid "1.2 Infrastructure Decisions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:149
msgid ""
"Here you will make two important infrastructure decisions: First you'll "
"choose your media processing architecture, then decide whether you need "
"recording. Reference topology for each architecture is provided."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:151
msgid "Media Service: RTCD or Integrated"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:153
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:319
msgid "**Integrated**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:155
msgid ""
"This is the simplest deployment model, since you do not need to provision"
" a separate service to handle media processing. In Integrated mode, the "
"Calls plugin runs its built-in media service directly on the Mattermost "
"server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:157
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:323
msgid "**RTCD**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:159
msgid ""
"RTCD is a dedicated real-time communications service for Mattermost Calls"
" that processes call media outside the main Mattermost server. In most "
"production deployments, **RTCD is the recommended deployment model** "
"because it improves performance, scalability, and stability by isolating "
"call traffic and reducing load on the Mattermost server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:161
msgid ""
"To determine if you'll need RTCD, start by answering the following "
"questions about your deployment:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:163
msgid "**Are you deploying Calls on Kubernetes?**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Yes:** You'll need to deploy RTCD as it's the only supported way to run"
" Calls. See the {doc}`Kubernetes <../../administration-guide/configure"
"/calls-kubernetes>` Calls deployment guide for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:165
msgid "**No:** Continue to the next question."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:166
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**What is the *Total User* count of your existing Mattermost "
"deployment?** _(Check {doc}`Site Statistics <../../administration-"
"guide/manage/statistics>`)_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:167
msgid "**Up to 50:** You can use the **Integrated** deployment model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:168
msgid ""
"**More than 50:** You'll need to deploy RTCD to avoid impacting messaging"
" performance of the Mattermost server."
msgstr ""

