#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:234
msgid ""
"You need your deployment to easily scale as call volume increases; "
"additional RTCD servers can be added for load balancing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:235
msgid ""
"You want the lowest possible media latency and highest reliability for "
"Calls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide.md:236
msgid "You are deploying Mattermost on Kubernetes, where RTCD is required."
msgstr ""

